            invite codes, creating a high-trust environment for true
            vulnerability.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Minimalist Design:</strong> A calm, &quot;light-first&quot;
            interface designed to reduce digital anxiety and promote mindful
            connection.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div> -->

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Why Color Lumie?</h3>
        <p>
          Because friendship isn&apos;t about likes or comments; it&apos;s about
          being seen. Color Lumie helps you identify which friend needs a coffee,
          which one needs a celebration, and which one just needs some space—all
          at a single glance.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
<!-- 
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Rebrand &amp; story</h2>
      <p>
        In this version, we have completely transformed the user experience to
        focus on emotional wellness and mindful communication. We replaced the
        generic friendship utility with &apos;Color Lumie&apos;—a system where
        users synchronize their emotional states through curated color palettes.
        The account requirement remains core to the experience because sharing
